  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/02/CarnavalEscolaDansa1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>La setmana passada i aquesta, el Centre de Dansa ha celebrat el Carnaval a les instalacions de la Uni&oacute; Musical d&#39;Onda. Un Carnaval diferent per&ograve; ple de disfresses, alegria i rialles contra la Covid-19.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalcentredansaumsco/20210216_173815.jpg\" alt=\"20210216_173815\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalcentredansaumsco/20210216_174036.jpg\" alt=\"20210216_174036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalcentredansaumsco/20210216_174103.jpg\" alt=\"20210216_174103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalcentredansaumsco/20210216_17411368477.jpg\" alt=\"20210216_17411368477\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalcentredansaumsco/carnavalescoladansa1.jpg\" alt=\"carnavalescoladansa1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalcentredansaumsco/carnavalescoladansa2.jpg\" alt=\"carnavalescoladansa2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalcentredansaumsco/carnavalescoladansa3.jpg\" alt=\"carnavalescoladansa3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalcentredansaumsco/carnavalescoladansa4.jpg\" alt=\"carnavalescoladansa4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnaval